    "body": "The nerd font preset previously mistakenly called the `[docker_context]` section `[docker]`. If you rename `[docker]` to `[docker_context]`, the first warning should disappear. Beyond that, the `[haskell]` module has been removed from starship because it was too slow, so if you remove the `[haskell]` section from the config file that warning should disappear too.\r\nSince this looks like the plain nerd font preset config file, you could also copy [the current version from the website](https://starship.rs/presets/#nerd-font-symbols) again instead.",
