    "created_at": "2021-10-06T11:35:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-06T11:35:18Z",
    "body": "> The nerd font preset previously mistakenly called the `[docker_context]` section `[docker]`. If you rename `[docker]` to `[docker_context]`, the first warning should disappear. Beyond that, the `[haskell]` module has been removed from starship because it was too slow, so if you remove the `[haskell]` section from the config file that warning should disappear too. Since this looks like the plain nerd font preset config file, you could also copy [the current version from the website](https://starship.rs/presets/#nerd-font-symbols) again instead.\r\n\r\noh, I see. Nise. After copying the config on the website, it works now. thanks :)",
